{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Combine and simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbcf82d0f16dc8b59a63f6649f13aee23905a9f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{6-3x}+\\frac{5}{x-2}-\\frac{3}{4-2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/74185e8e521053576d255e3131e0e6853d760de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad \\frac{-35}{6(x-2)} \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad \\frac{-35}{6(2-x)} \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad \\frac{35}{6(2-x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"363\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c79d7fb165f7d5f12dfa5bedd575d79aefff6c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad \\frac{6}{2-x} \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad \\frac{6}{x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"189\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The common denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a9910c85170c268d9239d22b7b7f843f23c588f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)(3)(x-2).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67ea1e4a215d4bc7a080219d7725a2b4aaf830a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{6-3x}+\\frac{5}{x-2}-\\frac{3}{4-2x}=\\frac{(-2)+6(5)-(-3)}{(2)(3)(x-2)}=\\frac{35}{6x-12}\\]\" width=\"464\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a53d27d9b3277ee74927ed8daec2257efe927062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_34\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 34\"> Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1363/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.857      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.857      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20680:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041643 and revision id 144655. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}